// ---- Notes ----
// - Under OptIn, a body property WITHOUT [JsonProperty] does not serialize at all.
//   Every field the server expects needs one — this is the failure mode OptIn trades for.
// - [JsonIgnore] every non-body member (Token, path ids, query values) so the
//   shape stays obvious to the next reader even though OptIn already excludes them.
// - A request must implement IRestRequest, IJsonDataRequest or IFieldDataSendRequest;
//   with none, the UnityWebRequest controller throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException.
// - Form bodies (IFieldDataSendRequest.DataField): string values only — anything
//   else goes through BinaryFormatter.
// - ApiClient strips a leading '/' and always appends a trailing '/'.
// - Routes follow captured samples, not the design doc and not the spec.
// - Add `using System.Collections.Generic;` beside the framework usings (inside
//   the namespace, as every file in Assets/game.shared/ does).
